sequenceDiagram
    actor UI
    participant ChatAPI
    participant MesaCompiler
    participant AtomsJson
    participant Gemini
    UI->>ChatAPI: POST /api/chat {message, session_id?}
    ChatAPI->>ChatAPI: get_session() / previous_turn
    ChatAPI->>MesaCompiler: compile(message, previous_turn)
    MesaCompiler->>AtomsJson: carga átomos (una vez)
    MesaCompiler-->>ChatAPI: mesa + prompt_mesa (items rankeados)
    ChatAPI->>ChatAPI: build_prompt(message, prompt_mesa)
    ChatAPI->>Gemini: generate_content(gemini-2.5-flash, prompt)
    Gemini-->>ChatAPI: reply (texto)
    ChatAPI->>ChatAPI: append turn a session
    ChatAPI-->>UI: ChatResponse {session_id, turn}